<title>UK: Hong Kong June air cargo traffic detailed.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong June air cargo traffic detailed.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics from by the Hong Kong civil aviation department show total air cargo handled in June by country rose 5.3 percent against the same period last year. Imports reached 62,097 tonnes and 62,870 for exports. The top 15 countries figures (rounded) are shown in tonnes in the table below in alphabetical order.</p>
<p>			UNLOADED	LOADED	  PCT CHNG FROM JUNE</p>
<p>							    1995 FOR ALL CARGO</p>
<p>AUSTRALIA	   3,335.5	 1,987.8	 -2.9</p>
<p>CANADA		2,082.2	 1,202.6	 75.6</p>
<p>CHINA MAINLAND    1,678.0	 2,739.2	  8.7</p>
<p>GERMANY	     3,444.4	 4,438.4	 11.6</p>
<p>INDONESIA	   1,291.0	   821.8	 11.7</p>
<p>JAPAN		 5,938.5	 9,537.8	 -5.0</p>
<p>KOREA,SOUTH	 3,207.1	 3,712.5	  6.0</p>
<p>MALAYSIA	    1,928.4	 1,351.7	  3.2</p>
<p>NETHERLANDS	 1,400.0	 1,177.7	 22.2</p>
<p>PHILIPPINES	 1,600.0	 1,632.0	  1.1</p>
<p>SINGAPORE	   4,227.1	 3,482.1	  9.3</p>
<p>THAILAND	    7,009.2	 1,949.0	 -2.0</p>
<p>UAE		     768.0	 1,124.0	  8.5</p>
<p>UNITED KINGDOM    3,540.2	 3,315.2	 11.8</p>
<p>USA		   4,489.5	14,038.2	  5.2</p>
<p>--Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
